 "prompt": "A plane transmission diffraction grating with $5000\\text{ lines/cm}$ is illuminated at normal incidence by monochromatic light of wavelength $\\lambda = 600\\text{ nm}$. Calculate the angular dispersion $\\frac{d\\theta}{d\\lambda}$ of the grating in the first order ($m = 1$) in units of $10^5\\text{ rad/m}$. (Give your answer to two decimal places).",
